window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>After letting his pack and his found family down, Ethan has left Grey Ridge on a mission to put things right. Being responsible for the near death of his friend's mate, he won't return until he gets revenge on those who attacked her. Nothing will distract him from his quest for justice, including finding his mate.</p> <p></p> <p>This is book 5 in the Shifters of Grey Ridge series, a steamy wolf shifter romance with enemies to lovers, rejected mates, forced proximity, and a happily ever after.</p>"; 
